GEOS 3.15 support for PostGIS 3.6.4, backported from the stable-3.6 branch of
PostGIS: !444 and !464.
Without it, ST_Split() of a line by points returns the line unsplit with GEOS
>= 3.15. The fixes are only used with GEOS >= 3.15.
Per https://github.com/pgdg-packaging/pgdg-rpms/issues/359
Remove when PostGIS 3.6.5 is released.

